Whenever I find something Christian, I reject, yes?

c0235
00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:39.000
It's incorrect, and we should do, you know, so on.

c0236
00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:42.000
But my...

c0237
00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:46.000
So I'm not sympathetic to ideas.

c0238
00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:49.000
I don't say that he did it deliberately,

c0239
00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.000
but some of the ideas come from...

c0240
00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.000
I mean, I find them in Christian theology.

c0241
00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:56.000
So, because they come...

c0242
00:15:56.000 --> 00:16:01.000
You know, I have one of those psychological fits, yes?

c0243
00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.000
Psychological bias, yes, so on.

c0244
00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:06.000
I should be more open, yeah?

c0245
00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:10.000
It's interesting, since we're talking about Christianity,

c0246
00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:14.000
I like very much the level, the grammatical level

c0247
00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:18.000
of our left-wing intellectuals in America

c0248
00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:21.000
