c0249
00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:24.000
In English, Judeo-Christian, Christian is the noun,

c0250
00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.000
and Judeo is the adjective.

c0251
00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.000
And that's very interesting, yes?

c0252
00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.000
Now, but I'm sure, I'm sure,

c0253
00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:33.000
that they still didn't figure out this, our intellectuals.

c0254
00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:37.000
Judeo-Christian means that a car is Christianity,

c0255
00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:39.000
and a car is...

c0256
00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:40.000
Judeo.

c0257
00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:43.000
Yeah.

c0258
00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:45.000
And one of your articles I read,

c0259
00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:47.000
but it's one that you didn't publish,

c0260
00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:51.000
it was on the computer,

c0261
