and has the Anabal Tamir Ya Hakhamim,

c0354
00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:52.000
the etiquette of Tamir Ya Hakhamim,

c0355
00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:54.000
in addition to his knowledge.

c0356
00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:58.000
And he is, I think, the Rabbi of the Mafdal, no?

c0357
00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:01.000
Yes, and the other is Rabbi Ashkenaz.

c0358
00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:02.000
So that's nice,

c0359
00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:05.000
but I would have liked that stronger things

c0360
