c0402
00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.000
He was a businessman.

c0403
00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:39.000
And they appreciated him in true Jewish fashion

c0404
00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:40.000
only after he died.

c0405
00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:41.000
After he died?

c0406
00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:44.000
Because he died without telling them anything.

c0407
00:23:44.000 --> 00:23:47.000
And once we went to Hachamat Lub al-Abadi,

c0408
00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:51.000
we wanted to go raise some funds for some money,

c0409
00:23:51.000 --> 00:23:53.000
I don't remember,

c0410
00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:54.000
and he tells me,

c0411
00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:55.000
come with me,

c0412
00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:57.000
